<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index fell to 1,465.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index fell to 1,465.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates fell to 1,465 today from 1,468 on Feb 19, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1543    14.006	  1559    14.156</p>
<p>   1a   1499 11350.000	  1498 11344.000</p>
<p>   2    1837    26.238	  1856    26.519</p>
<p>   2a   1848 15156.000	  1864 15288.000</p>
